{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    The sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers is given by (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        # As per instructions, no exception handling or isinstance checks,\n        # but a mathematical function typically expects n > 0 for \"first n natural numbers\".\n        # For n=0, the sum is 0, average is undefined or 0.\n        # Given assert find_Average_Of_Cube(2) == 4.5, n is expected to be positive.\n        return 0.0 # Or handle as per broader system error policy, but sticking to output type\n    \n    # Calculate the sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers using the formula:\n    # Sum = [n * (n + 1) / 2]^2\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) / 2)**2\n    \n    # Calculate the average by dividing the sum by n\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    \n    return average"}
