{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of even factors for a given number.\n    It orchestrates factor calculation, filtering, and summation.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # Helper function to calculate all factors of a number.\n    def _get_factors(num_to_factor: int) -> list[int]:\n        factors = []\n        for i in range(1, num_to_factor + 1):\n            if num_to_factor % i == 0:\n                factors.append(i)\n        return factors\n\n    # Helper function to check if a number is even.\n    def _is_even(num_to_check: int) -> bool:\n        return num_to_check % 2 == 0\n\n    # Helper function to sum even factors from a list of factors.\n    def _sum_even_factors(factors_list: list[int]) -> int:\n        even_sum = 0\n        for factor in factors_list:\n            if _is_even(factor):\n                even_sum += factor\n        return even_sum\n\n    all_factors = _get_factors(number)\n    total_sum = _sum_even_factors(all_factors)\n    return total_sum"}
